    "DialogTitle": "Sam council shire info",
    "PreviousBlocks": 1b,
    "DialogText": "Ah, the Shire… there’s no place like it, @p. Green hills as far as the eye can see, fields of barley and wheat, and the smell of fresh bread wafting through the air. Simple folk, with simple lives ... just how I like it. No dark lords or dangerous quests, just good, honest work and a bit of peace.

I miss it sometimes. The gardens, the quiet evenings at the Green Dragon… But I know why we’re out here. We’re fightin’ to protect all that, so folks back home never have to see the troubles we’ve seen.

One day, when this is all over, I’ll show you the Shire proper. You’ll love it, I promise.",
